<h2>Upcoming: Moss Landing Energy Storage Site Visit</h2>
<p>The Stanford Energy Club is organizing a <b>field trip to the Moss Landing battery storage facility</b>,
one of the world's largest lithium-ion battery installations.</p>

<p><b>Date:</b> February 20, 2026<br>
<b>Time:</b> 9:00 AM - 3:00 PM<br>
<b>Location:</b> Moss Landing, CA (carpool from Stanford)<br>
<b>Sign up:</b> <a href="https://example.com/moss-landing-trip">Register here</a></p>

<p>Spots are limited to 25 people. Priority given to energy and sustainability students.</p>

<hr>

<h2>Reminder: TomKat Center Fellowship Deadline</h2>
<p>The <a href="https://example.com/tomkat-fellowship">TomKat Center Graduate Fellowship</a>
for energy and sustainability research has a deadline of <b>February 15, 2026</b>.
Funding covers stipend + research costs for one year.</p>

<p>Good luck!<br>Stanford Energy Club</p>
